  "description": "The Premium Broadway sits at the top of our complete bike line up. As close to a pro level bike as you can get without breaking the bank, the Broadway features a stacked list of quality parts that compromise nothing. Starting with full chromoly frame, fork and handlebar as our material of choice, this bike is built to last and blast! Bolted to those tasty bits is some Premium double wall rims laced to sealed bearing hubs with a freecoaster out back, then wrapped in some 2.4\" Premium CK tires. The 9.5\" bars attach to an alloy top-load stem and spin with ease with the help of the Premium sealed bearing integrated headset.\n100% Cr-Mo frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell, integrated seat clamp and removable brake and cable mounts 21\" top tube.\n100% Cr-Mo fork with internal threaded steer tube and tapered legs - 28mm offset.\n100% Cr-Mo 9.5\" 4-piece bars with alloy Premium top load stem.\nPremium flangeless Team Grips.\nThree-piece seamless Cr-Mo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB.\n28/9 gearing with alloy sprocket.\nFully sealed wheels with front and rear double-wall rims, free-coaster rear hub.\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear.\nPremium Fat Capitol Pivotal seat with alloy Pivotal post.\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals.",
